#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:2
#: 03c6aa8b69cf41f5833bbdcdfcc2cda4
msgid "ADR 0012：GUI 卡顿与接口边界依赖 e2m2e 上游修复，本地不上子进程"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:4
#: f458c629503a432dbdc940fd4ef1ba65
msgid ""
"**状态**：已接受（上游 #312/#313 均已关闭，结果见后续更新） **日期**：2026-08-06 **关联**：ADR "
"0011（算法层直调）、e2m2e #312、e2m2e #313"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:8
#: 6cbc84ad29974fceacaa5682c6b46234
msgid "后续更新（2026-08-08）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:10
#: fca5837079be4ca98e12ceae4459c961
msgid "决策得到验证：上游两个 issue 均已关闭，冻窗已在本地根治。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:12
#: 55387d4a38f243d4be2cd547b28f9f3b
msgid ""
"**卡顿（#313，已于 2026-08-07 关闭）**：e2m2e 分两步修复并已由本仓消费：5.6.0（`dee042d`）把 CR3BP "
"族延拓切到 Rust `propagate_cr3bp_stm_py`，scipy 那段 ~70s 塌到 ~1.5s（第一层）；5.6.1 "
"给长期预报 `propagate_compiled` 补 `allow_threads`（第二层）。本仓 `pyproject.toml` 升至 "
"`e2m2e>=5.6.0`、`uv.lock` 钉 5.6.1（issue #354，2026-08-08）。默认 DRO + 1 月 "
"duration 复测：总耗时 23.4s、>2s 空档 0 次、最大空档 0.40s，冻窗消除。下文负面中的短期仍卡 66s+ 已不复存在。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:13
#: ef184d26c5864ec0b10a154b1e7a769b
msgid ""
"**更正背景一处误判**：背景称星历段 `propagate_compiled`（释放 "
"GIL）不阻塞，这是当时的误判。`propagate_compiled` 同样死持 GIL（主循环未包 "
"`py.allow_threads`），duration 拉长时它才是冻窗大头；即第二层。故实际修了两层，而非原以为的一层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:14
#: e02c211cde074e42a40c58c40acb3254
msgid ""
"**接口边界（#312，已于 2026-08-07 关闭）**：e2m2e Facade Response 已补齐 "
"`mu/states/times/ephemeris` 几何字段，按原计划可退回 Facade、移除 algorithm 层直调（ADR 0011"
" 缓解措施 3）。截至本次更新，`facade_bridge.py` 仍直调 algorithm 层，切换尚未完成，这是一次性清理，不阻塞功能。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:15
#: d73843113ebd41c485ddf42fd585c2be
msgid "**QMovie 转圈缓解措施作废**：冻窗已根治，原短期感知缓解不再需要。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:17
#: 5fcc217aa33b4522b78765c39cae31e9
msgid "背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:19
#: fd54666ba64d4c5c91998ccddf575b4e
msgid "2026-08-06 诊断出两个问题，根因都在 e2m2e 上游："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:21
#: a7141e632df248b78112ec94e380ac6c
msgid ""
"**一、GUI 生成轨道时卡顿（窗口无响应）。** `e2m2e` 的 `design_dro`（及共用 "
"`_propagate_with_stm` 的 `design_lissajous / design_halo` 等）用 "
"`scipy.solve_ivp` 跑带 STM 的积分，全程持有 GIL 约 66 秒（DRO duration=0.3 实测；cProfile"
" `design_dro` cumtime 69.7s、`equations_with_stm` 调用 423 万次）。worker 线程持 "
"GIL 期间，主线程 Qt 事件循环冻结，窗口拖不动、点击无反应，用户误判为崩溃、手动退出。星历段用 Rust "
"`propagate_compiled`（释放 GIL）不阻塞，唯独 CR3BP 修正段没切 Rust。**而 e2m2e 已导出 Rust "
"STM 积分器（`propagate_compiled_stm_py` / `propagate_with_stm_py`），未启用。**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:23
#: e445eb795d354beda17fc740b273c8df
msgid ""
"**二、接口边界穿透（ADR 0011 的遗留）。** ADR 0011 决定 GUI 直调 algorithm 层，因为 Facade "
"Response 剥离了几何数据；其缓解措施 3 写明 Facade 未来补全返回完整数据，可切换回 "
"Facade。此缺口现已具体化：`DesignOrbitResponse` 缺 `mu / states / times / "
"ephemeris`，`ControlOrbitResponse` 缺 `controlled_states / controlled_times"
" / mu`，下游画图、落盘、design→control 链式所需。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:25
#: 3182fc8559c1419496f60e6cf23e8aeb
msgid ""
"本地可选根治方案：`OrbitDesignWorker` 从 `QThread` 改 `QProcess` 子进程隔离，绕过 "
"GIL（架构改动，中等规模，且需适配 PyInstaller 冻结 exe 下 `python -m` 不可行的问题）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:27
#: 07a14a4ff32f416c8bd679cdd74138cb
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:29
#: f4fdbd172cde410c8f092c060ab60e46
msgid "**本地暂不上子进程隔离，两个问题都推 e2m2e 上游修复：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:31
#: 8f26f87676a2474fa2257af68a1962f0
msgid ""
"**卡顿（GIL）→ e2m2e #313**：把 `design_dro` 等的 STM 积分切到 Rust "
"`propagate_compiled_stm_py`，释放 GIL。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:32
#: a51f5e71ac1c42c58bcfaa6c32f26d79
msgid ""
"**接口边界 → e2m2e #312**：补齐 Facade Response 的几何字段。发版后本项目按 ADR 0011 缓解措施 3 退回"
" Facade，移除 algorithm 层直调。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:34
#: c5e1b33dc80a4612bedfdf359a9ca305
msgid "理由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:36
#: 11c844cfe3b4479b9c44fa68bf44bb58
msgid ""
"**不与上游重复**：GIL 的钥匙（Rust STM 积分器）e2m2e 已有，只是没接；本地子进程是绕路，上游切 Rust "
"才是正源。Facade Response 缺口同理，补字段是上游 Facade 的本职。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:37
#: 99f0491d70124cf4b7dd89264a830059
msgid ""
"**子进程方案有固有代价**：QProcess + IPC（pack/unpack DTO）+ PyInstaller "
"打包适配（`--worker` 子命令），改动面不小；上游修好后这些全成废码。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:38
#: 018572e0ba1f45b5be37f1c3bba4cb79
msgid "**上游修好后更干净**：退回 Facade（接口整洁）+ Rust 积分（不卡），比本地子进程 + 仍穿透 algorithm 两头凑更优。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:40
#: 285284d1103a4733902393da3098770c
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:42
#: d8b62953347a40fca3476b861a03fdad
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:44
#: 4f8336f5bc93447990c452d44538ff7a
msgid "本地零架构改动（与卡顿相关的代码不动）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:45
#: c5a5e62e06494a0589f10a93619a240f
msgid "上游修好后一次性解决卡顿 + 接口边界"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:46
#: 38326164eca24429afa4d6e6029a52e6
msgid "不引入子进程 IPC 复杂度与打包适配"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:48
#: 997278095e444f8396d904e6bef3c38c
msgid "负面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:50
#: 787c6212e3304461a1287cbf0f41ff3c
msgid "**短期 GUI 生成时仍卡 66s+**（等 #313 发版）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:51
#: c0a77f9b0e364a00841213d014598cbb
msgid "**仍穿透 algorithm 层**（等 #312 发版）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:52
#: 1386914dbfc8454f9363b7b78c7f7abd
msgid "依赖上游排期，不可自控"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:54
#: 5b175f526f1e4e7b8a323151dac2aba6
msgid "缓解措施"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:56
#: 0549cec122d647f7bd34e2ab39a57ec1
msgid ""
"**短期感知**：可给运行按钮加 C++ 转圈动画（`QMovie`），GIL "
"阻塞时动画照转，让用户看到正在计算（独立小改动，不与上游冲突、不与子进程绑定）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:57
#: 542116db1ae743da9ff26d9d02b6c855
msgid "**兜底**：若 #313 长期阻塞或技术上不可行（如 Rust STM 不支持 events / 穿越点检测），回头评估本地子进程隔离"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0012-defer-gil-and-facade-to-upstream.md:58
#: 7ae550a352d8487d942a7c7758e2320d
msgid "**跟踪**：#312 / #313 进展决定何时退回 Facade；届时修订本 ADR 或新增 ADR 记录切换"
msgstr ""

